ext-headline-600">10-year pricing.<br/>Locked in.</h1><p class="w-full text-body-500"><span style="color:var(--surface-text-secondary)">Predictable, annual pricing for the lifetime of your fund.</span></p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><img _type="image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1344" height="343" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full hidden sm2:block" style="color:transparent;margin-top:-8%" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/q8bht0jl/production/82fe37be27ff20790dd49d361ff6deed30df17fd-1344x343.svg"/><img _type="image" alt="" loading="lazy" width="335" height="121" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="sm2:hidden w-full" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/q8bht0jl/production/6521ff66ba9074949c4e1d86249ca3371c1d897e-335x121.svg"/></div></div></section></div></div></section></div><div><section class="scroll-m-header text-surface-text-primary relative bg-surface" data-theme="white"><div class="mx-auto w-full px-5 sm:px-9 md:px-10 xl:px-12 max-w-[1536px] grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-12 relative pt-12 md:pt-20 pb-12 md:pb-20"><div class="col-span-full lg:col-span-2"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-body-500 text-surface-text-section-label sticky top-header-spaced-8"><span class="block size-[0.66em] rounded-full bg-current"></span>Offerings</h3></div><div class="col-span-full min-w-0 lg:col-[3/-1]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-0"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full" style="max-width:100%"><h2 class="w-full text-headline-400">Modern fund admin, transparent pricing</h2><p class="w-full "><span style="color:var(--surface-text-secondary)">Software-enabled service with plans built for the nuances of venture.</span></p></div></div><div class="block w-full h-12"></div><div class="w-full grid sm:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(380px,1fr))] md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="bg-card-primary-active rounded-t-[3px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between" st