</div></div></div><div class="w-full @container" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="embla"><div class="embla__container flex w-full items-stretch gap-6 sm:gap-8"><div class="embla__slide bg-testimonial-ink text-surface-text-primary relative flex w-full shrink-0 select-none rounded-lg md:rounded-xl sm:min-h-[400px] sm:w-[calc((11*((100%-22rem)/12))+20rem)] @7xl:w-[calc((10*((100%-22rem)/12))+18rem)]" style="background-color:var(--testimonial-ink)" data-theme="ink"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-16 p-6 @2xl:p-10"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4"><blockquote class="max-w-[54ch] text-headline-200">There is zero chance we could operate at the speed, scope, and bandwidth we do without AngelList powering our entire back office. It feels like we have a team of specialists behind us on every deal, transaction, and situation.</blockquote></div><div class="flex w-full items-end justify-between gap-4"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-2 @5xl:flex-row @5xl:items-end @5xl:justify-between @5xl:gap-1"><div><div class="font-bold">Morgan Schwanke</div>General Partner, Mana Ventures</div><div class="[&amp;_path]:fill-current [&amp;_svg]:fill-current"><svg width="80" height="35" viewBox="0 0 80 35" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
