 operate at the speed, scope, and bandwidth we do without AngelList powering our entire back office. It feels like we have a team of specialists behind us on every deal, transaction, and situation.\"},{\"_key\":\"24191364cac3\",\"_type\":\"testimonial\",\"authorCompany\":\"General Partner, Sarah Smith Fund\",\"authorName\":\"Sarah Smith\",\"backgroundColor\":{\"_type\":\"simplerColor\",\"label\":\"Purple\",\"value\":\"var(--testimonial-purple)\"},\"image\":{\"_type\":\"image\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-ebe07fe04c7428ce03ac19102abcd7ae596b67ee-640x800-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"logo\":\"$38\",\"testimonial\":\"I was the LP on the other side of dozens of solo GPs and micro-funds. AngelList’s LP experience was far superior.\"},{\"_key\":\"b22cec9ed88c\",\"_type\":\"testimonial\",\"authorCompany\":\"General Partner, Banana Capital\",\"authorName\":\"Turner Novak\",\"backgroundColor\":{\"_type\":\"simplerColor\",\"label\":\"Gold\",\"value\":\"var(--testimonial-gold)\"},\"image\":{\"_type\":\"image\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-74289545e0a25123747106427f4992a1443e87ad-600x800-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"logo\":\"$39\",\"testimonial\":\"I looked into every provider and decided to stick with AngelList for my second fund. Their combination of price, features, customer service, and ability to support angel to institutional funds is unmatched.\"}]}}]\n"])</script></body></html>